00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:11.580
feels them best suited.

00:01:12.540 --> 00:01:14.340
Fired with this privilege of free

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:16.420
speech is our fellow worker

00:01:16.420 --> 00:01:18.160
Chester A. Riley.

00:01:19.310 --> 00:01:20.450
And I'm telling you

00:01:20.450 --> 00:01:22.250
