00:01:22.250 --> 00:01:24.300
prosperity. A vote for that

00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:25.900
gopher that's running against me

00:01:25.900 --> 00:01:28.050
is a vote for empty dinner pails

00:01:28.050 --> 00:01:30.000
and one pair of pants with every suit.

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:33.900
- I got planks in my head that'll satisfy everybody.

00:01:33.900 --> 00:01:38.540
