00:01:40.580 --> 00:01:42.940
I'm just running for president in my class.

00:01:42.940 --> 00:01:44.780
- Babs, an election is an election.

00:01:44.780 --> 00:01:46.620
You gotta mop out a campaign.

00:01:46.620 --> 00:01:48.900
- Now stop scouting, Riley, and eat your breakfast.

00:01:48.900 --> 00:01:51.220
- Well, that's a fine attitude for you to take.

00:01:51.220 --> 00:01:53.580
My daughter has run for the highest office in college

00:01:53.580 --> 00:01:55.040
and you're not even interested.

00:01:55.040 --> 00:01:56.630
- Highest office?

00:01:56.630 --> 00:01:59.120
Babs is just running for freshman president.

00:02:00.190 --> 00:02:04.430
the way i got this campaign figured the first thing i gotta do is to size up my opponent this

00:02:04.430 --> 00:02:09.390
helene bidwell she's not your opponent she's babs now you're not running for office so stay

00:02:09.390 --> 00:02:15.030
out of it and don't interfere well there must be something i can do sure pass the syrup

00:02:16.800 --> 00:02:25.630
all right so i won't interfere fine thing a guy can't even help his own daughter become president

00:02:26.170 --> 00:02:30.000
oh that's smart and popular she'll win the election i'm not

00:02:30.060 --> 00:02:35.480
for sure. Helene Bidwell has a lot of influence behind her. Her father's president of the

00:02:35.480 --> 00:02:40.920
Merchants Bank. So what? Anything that old miser Bidwell can do, your father can do better.

00:02:41.180 --> 00:02:45.420
Just name it. He gave Helene a hundred dollars for campaign expenses.

00:02:49.420 --> 00:02:54.950
Helene's giving lunches for the girls and handing out key rings to the boys. What? That's

00:02:54.950 --> 00:03:00.000
dirty politics. I'm drawing out every cent I got in his crummy bank. We haven't got a

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:01.700
any money in his bank.

00:03:01.700 --> 00:03:03.920
- Come in and then I'll draw it out.

00:03:03.920 --> 00:03:05.720
I don't have to do business with him, you know.

00:03:05.720 --> 00:03:09.320
They got just as good blotters at the First National.

00:03:09.320 --> 00:03:10.720
- Hey, Ryle, what's holding you up?

00:03:10.720 --> 00:03:11.920
- Oh, good morning, Mr. Gillis.

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:12.920
