00:03:39.930 --> 00:03:40.970
Don't argue with me.

00:03:41.860 --> 00:03:42.620
Who's arguing?

00:03:43.520 --> 00:03:45.840
I worked hard all my life. And now

00:03:45.840 --> 00:03:48.040
my daughter needs me to stuff the ballot boxes

00:03:48.040 --> 00:03:49.380
