00:03:49.810 --> 00:03:51.870
Did you tie your laces together again?

00:03:52.990 --> 00:03:53.490
No.

00:03:54.140 --> 00:03:55.790
What babes needs is a campaign

00:03:55.790 --> 00:03:57.950
