He used to be a politician back in Brooklyn.

00:04:09.520 --> 00:04:11.980
I campaigned for him when he was running for garbage commissioner.

00:04:12.240 --> 00:04:13.160
He's out here now.

00:04:13.770 --> 00:04:14.430
I'll phone him.

00:04:14.710 --> 00:04:15.530
He'll remember me.

00:04:16.060 --> 00:04:16.510
Wait a minute.

00:04:16.610 --> 00:04:17.430
Here comes the bus.

00:04:18.970 --> 00:04:20.310
Yeah, well, I ain't going to go to work today.

00:04:20.370 --> 00:04:22.330
I got to go see Feeney and get an angle for beds.

00:04:22.490 --> 00:04:23.810
What do I tell the foreman?

00:04:24.230 --> 00:04:24.950
Tell him something.

00:04:25.050 --> 00:04:26.050
Make up an excuse.

00:04:27.020 --> 00:04:28.460
All right, I'll tell him you're indisposed.

00:04:29.110 --> 00:04:30.000
No, he never.

00:04:30.190 --> 00:04:46.790
leave that. Tell him I'm sick. As I understand it, your little girl is running for Congress.

00:04:46.950 --> 00:04:53.280
Not Congress, President. President? There ain't no presidential election this year. Not President

00:04:53.280 --> 00:04:57.680
of the United States, President of her college class. You gotta help me, Mr. Feeney. My little

00:04:57.680 --> 00:04:59.890
babes has gotta win. Sure, Riley.

00:04:59.890 --> 00:05:00.000
Riley.

00:05:00.860 --> 00:05:04.640
I remember the things you did for me back in the old days.

00:05:04.640 --> 00:05:09.520
An honest Ed Feeney never forgets a friend.

00:05:09.520 --> 00:05:10.620
How many votes does she make?

00:05:10.620 --> 00:05:11.720
All she can get.

00:05:11.720 --> 00:05:14.710
You see, her opponent's old man is using unfair tactics.

00:05:14.710 --> 00:05:17.870
Oh, dirty politics, huh?

00:05:17.870 --> 00:05:19.370
You want us to mack 'em off?

00:05:22.550 --> 00:05:24.310
No, we ain't got time.

00:05:24.310 --> 00:05:26.910
They're handing out the fellas today and the election is tomorrow.

00:05:26.910 --> 00:05:28.740
Oh, we gotta move fast.

00:05:28.740 --> 00:05:30.000
I'm a little rough.

00:05:30.030 --> 00:05:30.990
on politics

00:05:30.990 --> 00:05:31.770
have been out of it

00:05:31.770 --> 00:05:32.790
since they impeached me

00:05:32.790 --> 00:05:33.910
on a garbage deal

00:05:33.910 --> 00:05:35.230
well all you did

00:05:35.230 --> 00:05:36.190
was collect the garbage

00:05:36.190 --> 00:05:36.990
and sell it back

00:05:36.990 --> 00:05:37.550
to the city

00:05:37.550 --> 00:05:39.510
technicalities

00:05:39.510 --> 00:05:42.370
I didn't want to fight

00:05:42.370 --> 00:05:43.790
my little bear's heart

00:05:43.790 --> 00:05:44.430
will be broke

00:05:44.430 --> 00:05:45.050
if she loses

00:05:45.050 --> 00:05:45.910
Mr. Feeney

00:05:45.910 --> 00:05:46.970
she won't lose

00:05:46.970 --> 00:05:47.790
I'll send a couple

00:05:47.790 --> 00:05:48.690
of my hoods

