What?

00:08:54.040 --> 00:08:57.520
Right on two point.

00:08:57.600 --> 00:09:00.000
Me and the boys stand out in a red-hot sun-collecting balance field.

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:30.000
you come and gum up the whites. I quit this here college. Babsy listen to me. No way I never want to speak to you again. What Babsy? You disgraced me. Friend of the whole college. I'll never be able to show my face again. Daddy how could you? I didn't know what Feeney was doing. You never talked

