- If she yells at me, I can yell right back at her.

00:10:31.050 --> 00:10:32.730
Let's go look in the window and see.

00:10:32.910 --> 00:10:33.290
Come on.

00:10:34.560 --> 00:10:36.840
Wait till I get my hands on your father.

00:10:37.260 --> 00:10:38.540
I'll teach him not to interfere.

00:10:39.780 --> 00:10:40.500
I'm trapped.

00:10:41.040 --> 00:10:41.680
You're a mouse.

00:10:42.340 --> 00:10:43.300
See you later, right?

00:10:43.460 --> 00:10:49.340
Do we have to wait for supper till Bob gets home?

00:10:49.520 --> 00:10:50.960
We most certainly do not.

00:10:51.370 --> 00:10:54.130
The way I feel right now, I don't care if he never eats again.

00:10:55.940 --> 00:11:00.000
You sure can't louse things up, kid.

00:11:01.950 --> 00:11:06.900
your language, Junior. It's alright for me to criticize your father, but not you. All

