I said was... I know what you said. Now take these potato peelings out. Okay, Mom. Junior!

00:11:20.880 --> 00:11:30.000
Did you want to hear you? Why didn't you come home out here? I was busy. You were scared. You're

00:11:30.120 --> 00:11:32.080
Father ain't scared of a man or a beast.

